:: Start [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Eat for Your Heart</span></div>
  <h1>Food and your blood pressure</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    What you eat has a direct effect on your blood pressure. Two things matter
    most: eating less salt and eating more potassium-rich foods.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Why">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Why [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Eat for Your Heart</span></div>
  <p class="lead">
    Salt makes your body hold on to water, which raises the pressure inside your
    arteries. Potassium, found in many fruits and vegetables, helps your body
    flush that extra salt out.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    You do not need a perfect diet. Small swaps, made often, add up to real
    change.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Play">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Play [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Eat for Your Heart</span></div>
  <h1>How to play</h1>
  <p class="lead">🥦 <b>Broccoli</b> — high in potassium, helps clear salt.</p>
  <p class="lead">🐟 <b>Salmon</b> — heart-healthy and low in sodium.</p>
  <p class="lead">🧂 <b>Salty snacks</b> — raise pressure, keep them small.</p>
  <p class="lead"><i>Each round you choose between two foods. Better choices clear the sludge building up inside your artery.</i></p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "See the games">>
      <<run
        try {
          if (window.FlutterBridge && window.FlutterBridge.postMessage) {
            window.FlutterBridge.postMessage(JSON.stringify({ type: "CCQ_OPEN_GAMES" }));
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      >>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>
